# Freeze values for F22 (2026-11-08). Same PREV_* as F21.env (the F20 records): F21 was qualified but its rehearsal was blocked at unit 2 by an unsettleable pre-admission launch failure, and the guest was restored to the pre-F21 checkpoint, so F20 is again the installed previous freeze. Line citations in comments below are F18-era history.
# Rules kept from the kit: no BOM, LF only, no quotes or trailing comment on FREEZE / FREEZE_COMMIT / GUEST_IP
# (freeze-guard.sh:8-11 reads FREEZE and FREEZE_COMMIT with sed; the mk-svc-config.py and mk-dr-config.py scripts split each non-comment line on "=").
# All comments are on their own lines.
#
# STATUS 2026-11-08: commit chosen (owner-authorized dev-to-main merge PR #102); admission ids committed (PR #101); the (2641c6bc, F22) measurer pair lands in a kit commit before 05.
# Every PREV_* value below was read from evidence/F18/logs, then read again on the cited line (the cited line contains the value).

